<section class="section" id="section-glossary">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 style="font-size:var(--fs-xl)">Glossary</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Every abbreviation and coding convention used on this platform, in one place.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="glossary-grid">
    <div class="glossary-card">
      <h4><svg><use href="#icon-home"/></svg>Institutions and partners</h4>
      <dl>
        <dt>WHO</dt><dd>World Health Organization</dd>
        <dt>AFRO</dt><dd>WHO Regional Office for Africa</dd>
        <dt>DPC</dt><dd>Disease Prevention and Control — the WHO AFRO cluster responsible for this platform</dd>
        <dt>NCD</dt><dd>Noncommunicable diseases</dd>
        <dt>WHO/HAI</dt><dd>WHO and Health Action International — co-authors of the medicine price, availability, affordability and price components survey method this initiative follows</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="glossary-card">
      <h4><svg><use href="#icon-target"/></svg>Global frameworks and instruments</h4>
      <dl>
        <dt>IGAP</dt><dd>Intersectoral Global Action Plan on Epilepsy and Other Neurological Disorders, 2022&ndash;2031</dd>
        <dt>GDO</dt><dd>Global Dementia Observatory</dd>
        <dt>EML</dt><dd>WHO Model List of Essential Medicines</dd>
        <dt>UHC</dt><dd>Universal Health Coverage</dd>
        <dt>mhGAP</dt><dd>Mental Health Gap Action Programme, WHO's clinical guideline for mental, neurological and substance use disorders</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="glossary-card">
      <h4><svg><use href="#icon-grid"/></svg>Status codes (milestone heatmap and country profiles)</h4>
      <dl class="glossary-status-list">
        <div class="glossary-status-row"><span class="status-pill st-NS">NS</span><span>Not started</span></div>
        <div class="glossary-status-row"><span class="status-pill st-IP">IP</span><span>In progress</span></div>
        <div class="glossary-status-row"><span class="status-pill st-C">C</span><span>Completed</span></div>
        <div class="glossary-status-row"><span class="status-pill st-D">D</span><span>Delayed &mdash; started, past its planned date, not yet completed</span></div>
        <div class="glossary-status-row"><span class="status-pill st-NA">NA</span><span>Not applicable to this country</span></div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="glossary-card">
      <h4><svg><use href="#icon-layers"/></svg>Coding conventions used on this platform</h4>
      <dl>
        <dt>ISO3</dt><dd>Three-letter country code (for example ETH = Ethiopia) &mdash; the join key used everywhere on this platform</dd>
        <dt>MoV</dt><dd>Means of verification &mdash; the document or record that evidences a milestone was actually completed</dd>
        <dt>P1&ndash;P5</dt><dd>The five implementation phases: governance and inception, preparation, data collection, data management and analysis, validation and policy translation</dd>
        <dt>M01&ndash;M31</dt><dd>The 31 milestone codes in the catalogue, numbered in phase order</dd>
        <dt>T01&ndash;T23</dt><dd>The 23 items in the tracer medicine and care product basket</dd>
        <dt>A&ndash;F indicator codes</dt><dd>The domain a results indicator belongs to: A availability, B price, C affordability, D policy and system, E coverage and use, F financing</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
